(text "Bus control. UHSIF CS# and WR# (active low) are driven low together while capturing: Y = CAP_EN_N\nAND CAP_QUAL. CAP_EN_N idles high through 10k; CAP_QUAL is tied high by a 0R, with a DNP 0R to VD_HS\nas an option to gate on HSOUT later. The 0R CS#-WR# link lets them be split." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 359 34 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "600d59f3-bcfb-4e9c-bd83-47aff39f478b"))
